ion patterns</article-title><source>PNAS</source><volume>95</volume><fpage>14863</fpage><lpage>8</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9843981</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="b27-cin-6-0369"><label>27</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kerr</surname><given-names>MK</given-names></name><name><surname>Churchill</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name></person-group><year>2001</year><article-title>Bootstrapping cluster analysis: assessing the reliability of conclusions from microarray experiments</article-title><source>PNAS</source><volume>98</volume><fpage>8961</fpage><lpage>5</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11470909</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="b28-cin-6-0369"><label>28</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Dudoit</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Fridlyand</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><year>2002</year><article-title>A prediction-based resampling method for estimating the number of clusters in a dataset</article-title><source>Genome Biology</source><volume>3</volume><fpage>RESEARCH0036</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12184810</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="b29-cin-6-0369"><label>29</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Tibshirani</surname></name><etal/></person-group><year>2005</year><article-title>Cluster validation by prediction strength</article-title><source>Journal of Computational and Graphical Statistics</source><volume>14</volume><fpage>511</fpage><lpage>28</lpage></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="b30-cin-6-0369"><label>30</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Monti</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>2003</year><article-title>Consensus clustering: A resampling-based met